abstract: >-
  Artifact for a pilot controlled sweep measuring how the granularity of
  LLM-agent decomposition affects accuracy, token cost, latency, and failure
  localization on a bounded, synthetic EU-style VAT-determination task. The
  repository ships a deterministic VAT oracle, a frozen synthetic dataset, the
  measurement harness, the raw run traces, and the analysis pipeline that
  regenerates every reported table.
